          </Pad>
          <Pad Id="KdNnFRIBXuDL7DxtpYlSXp" Bounds="85,85,520,94" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="Debug overlay&#xD;&#xA;- Debug pin of an element: only this element&#xD;&#xA;- Debug pin of the Renderer (optional): the whole window&#xD;&#xA;- Layout, size and hit-testing stay unchanged&#xD;&#xA;- Shows frame, origin, anchor, baseline, padding, spacing">
            <p:TypeAnnotation LastCategoryFullName="Primitive" LastDependency="CoreLibBasics.vl">
              <Choice Kind="TypeFlag" Name="String" />
            </p:TypeAnnotation>
            <p:ValueBoxSettings>
              <p:fontsize p:Type="Int32">9</p:fontsize>
              <p:stringtype p:Assembly="VL.Core" p:Type="VL.Core.StringType">Comment</p:stringtype>
            </p:ValueBoxSettings>
          </Pad>
          <Pad Id="fKtHF4vUCsMehGAkWvj7FA" Bounds="85,1168,830,110" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="Notes:&#xD;&#xA;- The Renderer's Debug pin is optional: right-click the node to show it.&#xD;&#xA;- Legend: turquoise = frame, magenta = origin, yellow = anchor, green = baseline/ascent, red = descent, orange = implicit size, orange dashed = children bounds, translucent = padding, hatched = spacing.&#xD;&#xA;- F5 in the window cycles the stats pages; the last one, Resources, lists the live resources (images) with state, size, refs and age, failed or stuck ones first, plus upload queue and budget.">
            <p:TypeAnnotation LastCategoryFullName="Primitive" LastDependency="CoreLibBasics.vl">
              <Choice Kind="TypeFlag" Name="String" />
            </p:TypeAnnotation>
            <p:ValueBoxSettings>
              <p:fontsize p:Type="Int32">9</p:fontsize>
              <p:stringtype p:Assembly="VL.Core" p:Type="VL.Core.StringType">Comment</p:stringtype>
            </p:ValueBoxSettings>
          </Pad>
